{"title":"Career Roadmap: International Auditor","role":"International Auditor","summary":"Career Domain: Business, Finance & Entrepreneurship · Qualification Pathway: Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India – ACCA (UK) / CPA (US) / CMA (US) · Target Career: International Auditor","facts":{"Current degree":"Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India","Course":"ACCA (UK) / CPA (US) / CMA (US)"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An International Auditor audits companies under international standards (ISA, IFRS, US GAAP) - often for global clients from India's Big 4 and audit delivery centres, or abroad."},{"type":"h","text":"What a International Auditor does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit financial statements under ISA / PCAOB standards"},{"text":"Test controls and transactions"},{"text":"Work with global audit teams across time zones"},{"text":"Document work to international quality standards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Big 4 global delivery centres"},{"text":"International audit firms"},{"text":"Multinationals' internal audit"},{"text":"Audit firms abroad"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Audit Associate"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Senior"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Audit Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Senior Manager"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Partner"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Applied Knowledge / early pa